       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Applies to:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " every examiner regardless of sex or gender, inpatient and outpatient (including labor and delivery), and studies like transvaginal ultrasound."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
